      "key": "ftb.shopkeeper.locked.hedge_witch",
      "en": "Carry the Witchery guidebook, a Verdant Sprig or a Witchery seed and I'll open my wares.",
      "zh": "携带巫术手册, 苍翠枝条或巫术种子, 我就向你开放货物."
